  "bodyHash": "sIehQxT1nfU=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/banner_128.png\" alt=\"盾牌庫橫幅\"></p><hr><h3>Shield Lib 是一個函式庫，可讓您輕鬆在 Fabric 和 Neoforge 上添加支援旗幟、附魔、自訂形狀和自訂效果的客製化盾牌，且無衝突！</h3><h3>我們還提供盾牌和盾牌附魔的事件掛鉤和修改器註冊，讓您透過修改格擋、禁用、移動或冷卻時間來創建自訂效果。</h3><h2>附魔：</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/showcase_enchanting.png\" alt=\"原版盾牌正在附魔\"></p><h2>自訂形狀：</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/showcase_shape.png\" alt=\"在 Blockbench 中的自訂方形盾牌模型，以及在遊戲中帶有地球旗幟圖案的樣子\"></p><h2>工具提示：</h2><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/showcase_tooltip.png\" alt=\"原版盾牌帶有一個新的工具提示，說明當它被斧頭擊中時將有 5 秒的冷卻時間\"></p><hr><h2>頁面：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshieldlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shield-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n</ul><h2>文件？</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/tree/main/docs/page/architectury/getting_started.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/architectury_64.png\" alt=\"Architectury\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/tree/main/docs/page/fabric/getting_started.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/fabric_64.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/tree/main/docs/page/neoforge/getting_started.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StellarWind22/Shield-Lib/refs/heads/main/docs/image/neoforge_64.png\" alt=\"Neoforge\"></a></p><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/CrimsonDawn45/Fabric-Shield-Lib-Example-Mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">範例模組儲存庫</a> 是一個模板儲存庫，如果您正在製作新模組，可以使用它快速入門。儘管它更新頻率較低。</h3>",
